{"c":[{"id":"d1eccd11dd08f3a5","sum":"Stockroom: DuckDB warehouse + dual-manifest Cursor/Claude plugin, engine in skills/sr-search/. WSL walker: a stale /mnt drive must not abort. Session view keeps \\.cursor paths (no CommonMark escapes); subagent pills never guess a turn; JSON keeps subagents/parent_spawn.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"d082cbb6d6679657","sum":"Stockroom: DuckDB warehouse + dual-manifest Cursor/Claude plugin; engine in skills/sr-search/. WSL walker: one stale /mnt drive must not abort. Cursor Path lines use backslashes; markdown-it collapses \\. (.cursor). Dashboard JSON export = full session_detail.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"a192d96d4c3ee4db","sum":"Stockroom: local DuckDB warehouse + dual-manifest Cursor/Claude Code plugin; skills sr-search/semantic/query/dashboard/initialize, engine in skills/sr-search/. Cursor model enrich WSL walker: one stale /mnt drive letter must not abort the walk.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260826T002308Z-d6e8a2c22f8985c0","text":"Stockroom: local DuckDB warehouse + dual-manifest Cursor/Claude Code plugin; skills sr-search/sr-semantic/sr-query/sr-dashboard/sr-initialize; engine in skills/sr-search/","type":"note"},{"name":"20260826T005853Z-6a18e7ec63e59a25","text":"Cursor model enrich WSL walker lists /mnt names then stats each child; one stale drive letter must not abort the walk.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"0a2c3d2fdf7f0057","sum":"Cursor skill Path lines use Windows backslashes; markdown-it collapses \\. so .cursor glues to the parent dir. Dashboard JSON export serializes full session_detail, so API payload additions change exported JSON unless filtered.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260826T134339Z-d618aad7ad08508d","text":"Cursor skill Path lines use Windows backslashes; warehouse keeps \\.cursor; dashboard markdown-it collapses \\. so .cursor glues to the parent dir.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260826T134816Z-efbe5193e7203f0e","text":"Dashboard JSON export serializes full session_detail; API payload additions automatically change exported JSON unless filtered.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"ea5c9d2bd405c3e0","sum":"Session view: bindSessionMarkdown disables CommonMark escapes so \\.cursor paths render; subagent pills (#msg-N-sa-M) + parent: line never guess a turn: Claude joins spawn ids, Cursor only aligned zip or unique agent_type, rest omitted; JSON keeps subagents/parent_spawn.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"2464ad6d4d98dee3","sum":"Session markdown-it disables CommonMark escapes (bindSessionMarkdown) so \\.cursor paths render; dashboard subagent pills omit unmatched Claude spawn ids, JSON export keeps messages[].subagents and parent_spawn, and leftover is Cursor-only (needs parent message ordinals).","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260826T135929Z-b16be49ee4a5a309","text":"Session-body markdown-it disables CommonMark escape via bindSessionMarkdown so \\.cursor and other hidden-dot paths survive render.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260826T140109Z-ffeba3eb9433dbab","text":"Dashboard subagent pills: Claude unmatched spawn ids omitted (no leftover); JSON export keeps messages[].subagents and parent_spawn; leftover is Cursor-only and needs parent message ordinals.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"b5e01e46143d148c","sum":"Dashboard session view shows corroborated subagent pills (#msg-N-sa-M) and a parent: line, never guessing a turn: Claude joins spawn ids; Cursor places only an aligned zip (count + agent_type==subagent_type) or a unique agent_type; holes/extras omitted; unknown harness: none.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260826T154745Z-a99acf23a825f6a2","text":"Dashboard subagent pills: never guess a turn. Cursor leftover gone. Place only aligned zip (count + agent_type==subagent_type) or unique agent_type. Omit holes/extras. Unknown harness empty.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260826T161338Z-78459a311c0536ae","text":"Dashboard session view now shows corroborated subagent pills (#msg-N-sa-M) and a parent: line; Claude joins spawn ids, Cursor places only aligned or unique agent_type pairs, unknown harness omits.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"8c758b43f9ea6ffb","sum":"Session view: subagent pills (#msg-N-sa-M) and parent: line only when corroborated. ERD: edges from -- @rel/@rel-none in migrations, views labeled name[\"name (view)\"]; sr-query SKILL.md keeps what ERD cannot show. No user-level uv indexes. sr-search sees scripts/ at ../../scripts","tree":{"c":[{"id":"29c75b2055bfd649","sum":"Session view: corroborated subagent pills (#msg-N-sa-M) + parent: line, never guessed. ERD edges: -- @rel / -- @rel-none in migrations/*.sql vs the head schema golden; no column docs from migration comments, @doc rejected. From skills/sr-search, root scripts/ is ../../scripts.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"ff5f55b02102dc3e","sum":"Session view: corroborated subagent pills (#msg-N-sa-M) + parent: line; Claude joins spawn ids, Cursor only aligned or unique agent_type pairs, unknown harness omits. ERD edges: -- @rel / -- @rel-none comments in migrations/*.sql, checked against the head schema golden.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260826T210631Z-10740a97904ab604","text":"Dashboard session view shows corroborated subagent pills (#msg-N-sa-M) and a parent: line; Claude joins spawn ids, Cursor places only aligned or unique agent_type pairs, unknown harness omits.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260829T161011Z-2822e87bc8170386","text":"Warehouse ERD edges: -- @rel / -- @rel-none comments in migrations/*.sql plus coverage against the head schema golden; not a Python relationship list and not a dummy DuckDB.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"e2a08ee3dba79144","sum":"Migration SQL comments are a write log, not a glossary: no column docs from them; @rel vs the head snapshot is the ERD edge source, @doc rejected. From skills/sr-search (uv --directory / Make UV_RUN cwd), repo-root scripts/ is ../../scripts, not ../scripts.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260829T162700Z-98da0bcb31c97c64","text":"Do not generate column-meaning docs from migration SQL comments: the chain is a write log, not a glossary. @rel vs head snapshot is the ERD edge source; @doc is rejected.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260829T164244Z-bd1d99298ee63baa","text":"From skills/sr-search (uv --directory / Make UV_RUN cwd), repo-root scripts/ is ../../scripts — not ../scripts (that is skills/scripts).","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"fd833a13d357171f","sum":"ERD views get Mermaid alias labels name[\"name (view)\"] (%% comments do not render), pinned by a rendered-output contract; sr-query SKILL.md keeps what the ERD cannot show (thinking not captured, tool inputs only, project_id/cwd/workspace_key/entrypoint); no user-level uv indexes.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"262cf27713e88954","sum":"Warehouse ERD views are labeled with Mermaid entity aliases name[\"name (view)\"]: %% comments do not render in erDiagram boxes, so views (session_token_usage) need a visible label, pinned by a rendered-output contract.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260829T190402Z-6371376f562b82e0","text":"QA for warehouse-schema-docs failed: Mermaid %% view comment is invisible in rendered ERD, so session_token_usage is not visually distinguished from tables; Build must make views visibly labeled/styled and add a rendered-output contract.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260829T190854Z-e3140d8fbabc94db","text":"Warehouse ERD views use Mermaid entity aliases name[\"name (view)\"]; %% comments do not render in erDiagram boxes.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"f0937a1056310039","sum":"sr-query SKILL.md keeps meanings the ERD cannot show (thinking not captured, tool inputs only, project_id/cwd/workspace_key/entrypoint); stockroom install never writes user-level uv extra indexes that bleed into other projects' locks.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260829T192526Z-070c0a987fc44833","text":"sr-query: replacing the column catalog with the ERD dropped meanings the picture cannot show; keep thinking-not-captured, tool-inputs-only, and project_id/cwd/workspace_key/entrypoint in SKILL.md.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260913T191146Z-bac17d4e200b9c2d","text":"Stockroom install must not write user-level uv extra indexes that bleed into other projects' locks.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"}]}
